VLOOKUP - searches for specific value in a range and returns a corresponding value in another row or column
Syntax - (lookup_value, table_array, column_number)
XLOOKUP - similar to VLOOKUP, but can search in any direction, works with inserting/deleting columns, more flexible
Syntax - (lookup_value, lookup_array, return_array)
INDEX - returns value at specific row/column in a range
MATCH - returns position of a value in an array
